{"version":1,"key":"card:598","content":{"id":598,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d574b50e-d69e-4672-a1f5-f2bab6a4b858","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在早期，由于用户量和流量较少，一台计算机也可以满足服务，然而时至今日，互联网用户的数量已不可同日而语，无论是出于高可用还是高性能的目的，企业都需要通过横向扩展机器来扩展服务能力，期望用户不论访问哪一台机器，都可以得到同样的服务，并且这件事情对于用户是透明的，不论背后是多少台机器在提供服务，用户只需要知道一个域名，就可以享受到服务。因此需要一种技术组件以统一的接口来调度后方的多台机器，这个技术组件就是负载均衡。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"405d21da-6f4c-4401-8b6f-6a9cee32e1d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"负载均衡："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1f8eb04f-5f0c-49da-a8b8-9931659586ee","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bee99107-6da3-4f51-a4fe-30da73c2f1b5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c25a3288-ed23-4cc1-8e9b-080136ffecaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DNS 负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ad0ad7d-5a42-4d17-8f1c-ea96c3ff4883","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 DNS 服务器配置多个 IP 地址，根据请求动态返回不同的 IP"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b72285eb-4ddb-4bb0-8319-398db64d828e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"de99b4aa-d1dd-4e5f-ba87-481820ba2982","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35d44180-ea36-4007-b7a8-664d6328a7d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四层负载均衡是多种负载均衡器的统称，主要工作在第二层（数据链路层，修改 MAC 地址）和第三层（网络层，修改 IP 地址），这里的四层是指这些模式的共同特点是复用同一个 TCP 连接"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a003c776-112d-4750-86b8-233e66320a45","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d3dd3dfb-652e-4958-914d-1d0a58ad9783","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a72e93d-5b41-4fd2-a9d9-1f35f5356845","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据链路层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3b5f5fe7-0d13-4226-be61-0c2f39e1057b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据链路层负载均衡器修改数据帧中的目的 MAC 地址，让原本发送给负载均衡器的数据帧，被二层交换机根据新的 MAC 地址转发到对应的真实服务器上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"630299d0-f8dc-43c5-b578-1ff56046d21b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务器为了能够处理转发的数据帧，必须保证和负载均衡器具有相同的 IP，正因此，响应报文无需经由均衡器转换，可以直接由服务器发送给客户端，避免负载均衡器成为瓶颈，性能是非常高的。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19f399b1-c63d-472d-8da1-7d686596242e.webp","uuid":"05c4b34f-a3e9-41aa-bdc6-c6d504ca49b0","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19f399b1-c63d-472d-8da1-7d686596242e.webp","width":648.312456313768,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a083675c-0fdc-407e-bd95-a756173e24e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35c63258-8a3f-4f20-b713-76dae534625f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点是在网络侧受到了约束，要求真实服务器和负载均衡器必须是二层可达的，即在一个子网中，无法跨 VLAN，因此这种负载均衡器常用于数据中心的第一级均衡设备。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f3ff469c-c364-43d3-a784-753083fa12e9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0bc1dd57-a875-4210-aaef-54387d2e69a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4e32bf7-868d-44ae-945a-f2e01afc17f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种常见的修改方式："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c14cfff9-c222-4c19-8c58-2274c5eef63c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a1001cc7-b6e2-4393-82d2-353a9aa1b96c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b190745a-0b37-445a-8742-a446320de4a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 隧道"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"769ef7b0-e08e-44d8-a83f-26f914ca766a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持原数据包不变，新创建一个数据包，将原数据包作为新数据包的负载，新数据包的目的地址修改为真实服务器的地址，然后发出去，经过三层交换机的转发，真实服务器受到后需要进行一个拆包的机制，把负载均衡器添加的那层 Header 去掉，还原出真实的数据包。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a05a89c-09ba-4d47-ab0c-28b4cb157232","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于需要进行封装新的数据包，效率比直接进行路由转发效率较低，但是由于没有修改数据包，响应仍然可以通过服务器直接发送给客户端。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dbf784e-92a0-4c6a-aeae-5247f75adcc8.webp","uuid":"fb483e18-7f36-41a9-9196-595f133f41c9","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dbf784e-92a0-4c6a-aeae-5247f75adcc8.webp","width":687.712660841124,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4914073f-711d-4d0a-bac4-00d0bfef8d00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5829131a-82fa-427e-9094-7c8033d9cf2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而且 IP 隧道工作在网络层，可以跨越 VLAN。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd2de76a-075d-414b-9f3d-51c68fbd2bdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此种方式要求服务器必须支持 "},{"type":"styled-text","color":"blue","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"ee9c464d-a362-408f-8c7a-bfe623b04c6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 隧道协议"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，自己得会把外层的那层包给拆掉，另外同样，服务器必须配置为与均衡器具有相同的 IP，不太"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"透明"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，需要系统管理员介入。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"658b5cac-c3e4-441f-bb4d-835f5002cdd7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"55f17a7e-47cf-4743-8904-fbc7bc7c2d1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"NAT"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"99852727-5102-4ae6-a3ab-5896c3c835c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接修改数据包的头部，把头部中的目标 IP 地址修改为服务器的地址，然后发送出去，被三层交换器转发到真实服务器上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46d5b9de-83ea-4dda-af6e-d59827963106","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"带来的问题是修改了数据包，真实服务器无法直接把响应发送给客户端，因为对客户端来说它发送出去的目的 IP 地址不是真实服务器的 IP 地址，客户端可能不认识该 IP，因此得让响应回到负载均衡器，然后把源 IP 地址修改为负载均衡器的 IP 地址。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1d987bf8-f656-4402-a361-09e4dc802e0b.webp","uuid":"7dd1f78f-e09e-4da0-9c64-145595cecd16","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1d987bf8-f656-4402-a361-09e4dc802e0b.webp","width":687.712660841124,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"dcdced60-f8f5-4de8-a67a-c2fb74ef566a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b9f43ef-867f-4f2a-9e7c-ccad549d0e9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此种方式不要求均衡器和服务器具有相同的 IP，带来的代价是均衡器可能成为带宽的瓶颈，当流量比较大的时候，相比于直接路由和 IP 隧道，会呈现数量级的下降。在学校，公司，家里面就是这样的模式，所以若是有人在下载，你的网络会卡顿是一个道理。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"思考","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"7b19d380-a7a8-46c9-9b91-554757a00bf7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ab22fb65-e008-441b-a026-fab0f27d2dc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当真实服务器发送响应的时候，为什么一定会经过均衡器返回呢？是不是有做什么操作？应该在转发请求的时候，把源 IP 地址给改了，改为均衡器的地址，这样通过网络才能保证回到均衡器，然后均衡器在把源 IP 地址目的 IP 地址修改正确。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ae21c38-ce6a-4f19-9c47-33459fbfd680","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个就是更彻底的 NAT 模式，称为源 NAT（SNAT），缺点是服务器无法获取客户端的 IP 地址了，因为服务器认为所有的流量都来自于均衡器，如果有一些需要根据目标 IP 进行控制的业务就无法进行。"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":